# Figure 1 is a bitmap, so unlike the other figures it is a PDF. It is generated
# by make_all.py, but tracked alongside fig-*.pgf and table.tex so that a clone
# can build the paper with LaTeX alone, without a Python environment.
!manuscript/fig-slog2d.pdf

# generated by web/build.py, but tracked so that GitHub Pages can serve it
